@startuml
title UML sequence — Set a new password and land on the role home (L2-115 criteria 5 to 8)
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
actor "Sofía (Youth)" as sofia
box "Frontend — Angular app (account, api, components)" #E0F2FE
participant ResetPasswordPage as page
participant AuthApi as client
participant ToastService as toast
end box
box "Backend — PromiseHub.Api" #D1FADF
participant AuthEndpoints as api
end box
box "Backend — PromiseHub.Application" #ECFDF3
participant PasswordResetHandler as handler
end box
sofia -> page : opens the emailed link
page -> client : checkReset(token)
client -> api : GET /auth/reset-password/{token}
api -> handler : CheckAsync: newest, unused, under an hour, account current
api --> page : email, or 410 This link has expired (c7)
sofia -> page : new password twice
page -> client : resetPassword(token, password, repeat)
client -> api : POST /auth/reset-password
api -> handler : ResetAsync
handler -> handler : PasswordPolicy.Check (L2-116), repeat matches
handler -> handler : new hash, link used, session version + 1, audit in her first organization (c8)
api --> client : session cookie
page -> client : GET /me (SESSION_API)
page -> toast : Password updated
page -> sofia : roleHome: Learning, Mentoring, or Today while the module is off (c5, c6)
@enduml
